{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>To the land of Ha-Moriah.</b> The Amorite land, the land of the Amorite. Several words are defective in alef: וימש חשך — לא יהל — there Shem is an Arab." "<b>And offer him there as an offering.</b> He said before Him: Master of the universe, is there an offering without a priest? He said to him: I have already appointed you a priest, as it is written: ״HaShem has sworn and will not relent: you are a priest forever, on the matter of my saying, Malki-Tzedek.״"], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:05:16.310130321Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}